[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13141.269, "timestamp": "03:39:01", "text": "然后告诉你们。好的，首先如果我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13143.91, "timestamp": "03:39:03", "text": "要开始直播了吗？呃，我们聊聊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13145.67, "timestamp": "03:39:05", "text": "前面谈到了条件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.59, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "这很合乎逻辑，对吧？所以，我会把它自动化。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.51, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "这样我就可以只安排直播了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13155.59, "timestamp": "03:39:15", "text": "在 YouTube 上。就是这样。不要碰"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13157.429, "timestamp": "03:39:17", "text": "完全不和谐。它会自动执行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13160.71, "timestamp": "03:39:20", "text": "对我来说是这样。所以，呃，其中一件事是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13163.11, "timestamp": "03:39:23", "text": "据说这是个有条件的事情，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13166.389, "timestamp": "03:39:26", "text": "将当前时间与……进行比较"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13168.79, "timestamp": "03:39:28", "text": "剩余时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13171.269, "timestamp": "03:39:31", "text": "YouTube 直播的开始时间是什么时候？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13175.75, "timestamp": "03:39:35", "text": "所以如果是的话，就像……如果是的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13179.99, "timestamp": "03:39:39", "text": "大概一个多小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13183.269, "timestamp": "03:39:43", "text": "呃，离开是为了等待日程安排开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13186.469, "timestamp": "03:39:46", "text": "那么就需要一个多小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13188.71, "timestamp": "03:39:48", "text": "那它就会变成一个候诊室之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13192.07, "timestamp": "03:39:52", "text": "信息。如果只剩下10分钟了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13194.95, "timestamp": "03:39:54", "text": "它会像直播一样发送出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.11, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "现在或者差不多，或者10分钟后或者"}]